    "summary": "Authorizes the migration from Statecraft github-actions-rust revision 28 to revision 29 in one pull request. Revision 29's policy-isolation guard ignores, as new-crate, the manifest and lockfile blocks of a new workspace crate that adds no registry or git package, so a new crate lands in one pull request. The producer still links spec-spine-core 0.32.0, so the exact engine pin does not move. Aicortex keeps its ordinary Rust code gate, corpus attestation and spec DAG jobs, and every recorded setup parameter.\n",
